": "1649951459463035", "uri": "https://scontent-iad3-1.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/499623443_1649951462796368_6495437171366118499_n.png?_nc_cat=106&_nc_map=urlgen_bucketless&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=ZolCeK0M9AoQ7kNvwE4ZkYP&_nc_oc=Adqhwp76Z_zzx5L-f8q8mo9b5mIH8JIYGXIH-qGfdLje5hgJOUI1J1hSEwItCBs1FDk&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-iad3-1.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_AQRtU6UCjmwC-d2QLRteK5SxAHOqHbHoy_UT5teUGQdKsQ&oe=6B008348"}, {"file_name": "ScreenShot3.png", "id": "796010373336947", "uri": "https://scontent-iad6-1.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/499619672_796010376670280_1622690528672245878_n.png?_nc_cat=109&_nc_map=urlgen_bucketless&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=nH5z-YeHQSgQ7kNvwEWEFQ_&_nc_oc=AdrwT-wcVESNkhZEsEt-4O2Rb8Tu_DIuTqhdG7gkN6zOQHAEFqAGc8L2lYx0_DA3qS8&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-iad6-1.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_AQRalfPpRw_XCoffr7smHRiOGG48BkzP5sQM65tbfE0qdQ&oe=6B007E48"}, {"file_name": "ScreenShot4.png", "id": "900207153052082", "uri": "https://scontent-iad6-1.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/499619594_900207156385415_3810073691747307333_n.png?_nc_cat=110&_nc_map=urlgen_bucketless&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=GsPvITKW6dIQ7kNvwG_8gs7&_nc_oc=AdrDGMqiTJit8phijqrChU3H-ktIHov_e6_Zetc_kZWs8vkKLuxweT4o9lccTXGispQ&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-iad6-1.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_AQRmrnz85beaWeKxPUhnzoPr498u4zfOb3wu9yAwlpJOWg&oe=6B005D6F"}, {"file_name": "ScreenShot5.png", "id": "947398901258988", "uri": "https://scontent-iad6-1.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/499622214_947398904592321_4765479034696321724_n.png?_nc_cat=103&_nc_map=urlgen_bucketless&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=0TuDfsnMAmQQ7kNvwG6X2M0&_nc_oc=Ado1nPLAwXTTHHyV030cEqSMuRXKmj2h5PnTvVQtVQywR9zrox0EJEjxf9WLszeRc6o&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-iad6-1.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_AQR9D5yGVt2eMzo68WJ35l2KDPNK_1Ki4y2P7KC_sz-DUA&oe=6B007E3F"}], "video_trailer": null, "video_trailer_thumbnail": {"file_name": "Snapshot_1.PNG", "id": "712382138600986", "uri": "https://scontent-iad3-1.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/499618444_712382141934319_6039130477330376030_n.png?_nc_cat=103&_nc_map=urlgen_bucketless&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=29T46wHs7BgQ7kNvwG4724D&_nc_oc=Adp4YCzbBjCAXEYM00X5yrvCMl_4T3HlruBg8lf7pEbvpvb_Uxn4MKupUazgRPMj_18&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-iad3-1.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_AQQxT8TEW-UUpx9U7owwdVIS1wb8KNmheciZ56l3UqBePg&oe=6B007D85"}, "display_name": "The Abstract Art Gallery", "keywords": ["Abstract", "Art", "Gallery", "Neon", "Paintings"], "long_description": "The Abstract Art Gallery is a VR Experience that shows 60 paintings of the famous painter Wassily Kandinsky  (1866 \u2013 1944). He was one of the most important 20th-century artists. He was a major figure in modern art and painted some of the first modern abstract works.\n\nThe experience does not show the original paintings of Wassily Kandinsky, instead it presents a Neon-Futuristic version of each painting. You have a play button on each panting to see an AI Animation made with the Meta AI.\n\nThe exposition is divided in 6 sections (each section contains 10 paintings), and there is a transportation point to move from one section to another.\n\nKandinsky also developed a theory of geometric figures and their relationships, claiming (for example) that the circle is the most peaceful shape and represents the human soul.", "short_description": "The Abstract Art Gallery is a VR Experience that shows 60 paintings of the famous painter Wassily Kandinsky  (1866 \u2013 1944)."}]}, "developer_name": null, "developer_privacy_policy_url": "https://midicreationsvr.blogspot.com/p/privacy-notice-last-updated-april-15_19.html", "developer_terms_of_service_url": null, "publisher_name": "Midi Creations", "support_website_url": null, "website_url": "https://midicreationsvr.blogspot.com/p/who-are-we-indie-virtual-reality-video.html", "category": null, "comfort_rating": "COMFORTABLE_FOR_SOME", "comfort_tags": [], "context_category": {"id": "362692211442873", "context_category": "APPS"}, "context_topics": [{"id": "4349619